hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"115","\The Prophet (Allah bless him and give him peace) addressed the people while wearing a black turban.”"""""
"116","\When the Prophet (Allah bless him and give him peace) donned a turban"","" he let his turban hang down between his shoulders.”"""""
"117","“The Prophet (Allah bless him and give him peace) addressed the people while wearing a turban that was dasma’ [marked with traces of oil from his hair]."
"118","“'A'isha (may Allah be well pleased with her) brought out to us a tangled garment and a coarse loincloth, then she said: ‘The spirit of Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace) was taken in these two'.”"
